  "definition_ja": "2 で割り切れる整数。n を整数として 2n と表せる数で、0 も偶数である。",
  "definition_en": "An integer that can be divided by 2 with no remainder, such as −4, 0, 2, or 10. Every even number can be written as 2n, where n is an integer.",
  "latex": "2n",
  "spoken_en": "two n",
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": "Remember, zero is an even number too, since 2 times 0 is 0.",
      "ja": "0 も偶数だよ。2 × 0 = 0 だからね。",
      "register": "spoken"
    },
    {
      "en": "Let m and n be integers. Show that the sum of the even numbers 2m and 2n is also an even number.",
      "ja": "m, n を整数とする。偶数 2m と 2n の和も偶数であることを示せ。",
      "register": "written"
    }
  ],
  "collocations": [],
  "pitfalls": [
    "「12 は偶数だ」は 12 is even. と形容詞 even だけでも言える。",
    "0 も偶数（0 = 2 × 0）。負の数も −4 = 2 × (−2) のように 2n の形になれば偶数。",
    "偶関数（even function、エントリ even-function）の even と同じ語。偶数か奇数かという性質は parity（エントリ parity）。"
